@arrow_bonus_tier_2! Filter by @peasants![ShowPopTypeName('peasants')] [buildings] and click on the [ShowBuildingTypeName('market_village')] [building].

@arrow_bonus_tier_1! Build it in the [location_with_icon|e] by clicking it on the list or on the map.

